WEBVTT

01:39.390 --> 01:42.894
Are you making a fool of me?

01:44.145 --> 01:46.022
I'll ask just one more time.

01:47.607 --> 01:50.193
You guys being bullied?

01:52.278 --> 01:53.238
No, ma'am.

01:57.075 --> 02:00.036
Don't hide it. Just tell me.

02:00.120 --> 02:03.373
I have zero tolerance for bullying.

02:04.082 --> 02:07.335
I am on your side.

02:07.961 --> 02:09.379
Thanks, ma'am.

02:11.714 --> 02:14.425
Queen Sensei, you have a call
in the teacher's office.

02:15.093 --> 02:16.719
Damn baldie!

02:16.803 --> 02:20.932
I told ya, don't open the door
without knocking first!

02:21.683 --> 02:23.852
I'm sorry, Queen Sensei!

02:23.935 --> 02:25.854
Looks like you need some discipline.

02:25.937 --> 02:29.190
- Discipline? Um...
- Rotten scumbag. Cue balls like you...

02:31.693 --> 02:35.446
I'm stepping out for a bit.
You guys can stay as long as you like.

02:37.115 --> 02:38.283
Thanks, ma'am.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.495
What am I gonna do?
People saw me in a weird situation!

02:42.579 --> 02:46.374
My popularity! My innocent image!

02:46.457 --> 02:49.377
More like, them aliens
are way too persistent!

02:49.460 --> 02:53.214
If they keep assaulting us like that,
I won't be able to stand it!

02:53.298 --> 02:56.092
On top of that, they were targeting me.

02:56.175 --> 02:59.804
It seems like they were after
Turbo Granny's powers.

03:00.930 --> 03:02.181
Hey, by the way...

03:03.141 --> 03:07.270
Since when have you been able
to use Acro-Silky's powers?

03:07.353 --> 03:10.982
Just now. My powers awakened
during the battle.

03:11.065 --> 03:14.819
I mean, I was chosen
as a "Pretty Soldier" after all.

03:14.903 --> 03:17.530
Your title keeps changing so much.

03:17.614 --> 03:21.659
Well, we did transfer Acro-Silky's aura
to you, so I guess it's possible.

03:21.743 --> 03:23.036
But if that's the case,

03:23.119 --> 03:25.997
it's highly likely that Miss Shiratori
will also be targeted by them.

03:26.080 --> 03:28.958
Takakura-kun is worried about me.

03:29.042 --> 03:31.794
We were able to fend them off
because we had yokai powers.

03:31.878 --> 03:35.381
But as long as we have these powers,
the aliens will be targeting us.

03:35.465 --> 03:37.175
But isn't it strange?

03:37.258 --> 03:39.260
If they want yokai powers,

03:39.344 --> 03:41.554
they should just attack
the yokai directly.

03:41.638 --> 03:43.223
You're right.

03:43.306 --> 03:45.725
No, wait. That's exactly it!

03:45.808 --> 03:46.517
The aliens,

03:46.601 --> 03:49.229
despite having astounding scientific
technology, are not invading Earth.

03:49.312 --> 03:53.691
There's much debate about that,
and I was always curious about it!

03:54.859 --> 03:56.945
They can't because
we have yokai monsters around!

03:57.028 --> 03:58.363
They're not just in Japan!

03:58.446 --> 04:01.324
Folklore about spirits and demons
exist all over the world!

04:01.407 --> 04:05.995
In other words, yokai and demons are
protecting the Earth from alien invasion!

04:06.079 --> 04:09.332
Even with their scientific technology,
aliens can't beat yokai.

04:09.415 --> 04:12.877
Thus, they're attacking special humans
like us for research,

04:12.961 --> 04:16.422
and they're trying to develop technology
to win against the yokai!

04:16.506 --> 04:17.632
I'm sure of it!

04:18.258 --> 04:22.762
There's a chance they already took
my missing family jewel!

04:22.845 --> 04:25.139
Oh crap! We gotta hurry and find it!

04:25.223 --> 04:27.767
The story went too epic
and I totes missed the point!

04:27.850 --> 04:29.602
So what? Are we in trouble?

04:29.686 --> 04:33.982
I get it! I still hold
the fate of the world in my hands!

04:34.065 --> 04:35.900
Fine, we'll go with that.

04:36.609 --> 04:39.988
Anyway, people saw me naked!

04:40.071 --> 04:43.032
Ugh, don't remind me of reality!

04:43.116 --> 04:46.869
I'm sure nobody would believe
anything we'd say anyway.

04:46.953 --> 04:48.288
Oh, what to do!

04:48.371 --> 04:49.580
That's it!

04:49.664 --> 04:52.125
I'll just say that Miss Ayase stripped me!

04:52.208 --> 04:54.294
- Hey!
- It's not a lie, is it?

04:54.377 --> 04:56.254
You did tell me to strip down.

04:56.337 --> 04:58.047
Takakura-kun,
you should go with that, too.

04:58.131 --> 04:58.965
Huh?

04:59.048 --> 05:00.550
Fine, you can go with that.

05:00.633 --> 05:02.135
But if we do that, then you...

05:02.218 --> 05:05.388
I'm kinda tired. Making excuses
sounds like a pain in the ass.

05:05.471 --> 05:07.765
- Aira, are you okay?
- What happened to you?

05:08.683 --> 05:10.059
You surprised me!

05:10.143 --> 05:12.729
Oh! Momo Ayase, is this your fault?

05:12.812 --> 05:13.730
Uh, um...

05:13.813 --> 05:14.939
Let's go, Aira!

05:15.023 --> 05:15.857
Wait, hold on.

05:15.940 --> 05:19.235
Miss Ayase, if you don't hurry,
you'll turn into the villain!

05:19.319 --> 05:20.945
I could care less.

05:21.571 --> 05:23.364
You don't care?

05:23.448 --> 05:25.825
More than any of this...

05:25.908 --> 05:28.661
Okarun, give me your excuse
for that other thing.

05:29.245 --> 05:32.206
What were you doing there
during the lunch break?

05:32.290 --> 05:33.416
That was...

05:33.499 --> 05:36.627
Miss Shiratori tried to kiss me
out of the blue.

05:36.711 --> 05:38.254
- Huh?!
- It's true!

05:38.337 --> 05:40.214
We got into a tussle because of that,

05:40.298 --> 05:43.342
and when we both fell over,
that's when you happened to see us.

05:43.426 --> 05:46.971
So then, what were you
doing there to begin with?

05:48.431 --> 05:50.933
C'mon. C'mon.

05:53.853 --> 05:54.979
I was working out.

05:55.646 --> 05:57.231
Like push-ups and stuff.

05:57.315 --> 05:58.441
Oh?

05:58.524 --> 06:00.485
I wanted to become stronger.

06:01.235 --> 06:04.030
And why'd ya want to keep it a secret?

06:04.655 --> 06:05.490
Um...

06:06.199 --> 06:10.453
If I got stronger without you knowing,
I thought it would be kinda cool.

06:10.536 --> 06:12.246
Say what? Hilarious!

06:12.330 --> 06:14.290
Okarun, you have a vain side, too?

06:14.373 --> 06:16.167
O-Of course I do.

06:16.250 --> 06:19.045
I am a guy after all.

06:19.128 --> 06:22.673
I want you to think I'm a cool guy.

06:28.679 --> 06:31.057
I see, I get it.

06:31.140 --> 06:32.975
Lemme see your face.

06:33.059 --> 06:36.938
D-Don't tease me!
That's the bad thing about you.

06:37.021 --> 06:39.816
So why? Why do you want me
to think you're cool?

06:39.899 --> 06:42.318
Huh? I told you. It's because I'm a guy!

06:42.401 --> 06:45.196
Why do you want people to think that
just because you're a guy?

06:45.279 --> 06:48.825
Huh? That's enough of that!

06:49.617 --> 06:51.369
I'll be going now!

06:51.452 --> 06:54.372
I won't say anything
that'll make you the villain though.

06:55.748 --> 06:56.791
Okarun.

07:19.313 --> 07:20.273
Found Momo!

07:20.356 --> 07:21.607
Okarun is here, too!

07:21.691 --> 07:23.776
Whoa! You surprised me!

07:23.860 --> 07:25.361
No, that's our line.

07:25.445 --> 07:27.530
You suddenly disappeared on us
during class!

07:27.613 --> 07:29.740
Kana contacted us. I was totally spooked.

07:29.824 --> 07:33.327
She said you and Okarun were hugging
each other naked in front of Class D.

07:33.411 --> 07:35.455
But we were all in chemistry lab, right?

07:35.538 --> 07:37.206
So what's going on?

07:37.999 --> 07:40.960
Even if I told you,
you wouldn't understand.

07:41.043 --> 07:43.212
That's just how things ended up.

07:43.296 --> 07:44.130
I see.

07:44.213 --> 07:45.673
Isn't that a little too vague?

07:46.257 --> 07:47.800
All the mysteries have been unraveled.

07:47.884 --> 07:49.177
Whoa, amazeballs!

07:52.013 --> 07:56.809
You. There's a person
named Shiratori in Class D.

07:56.893 --> 07:59.896
So, uh, do you know her?

08:02.148 --> 08:03.649
Well, yeah.

08:05.276 --> 08:12.116
My investigations show that
Shiratori in Class D was also naked.

08:12.783 --> 08:16.662
Which brings us to Momo,
Okarun, and Shiratori.

08:16.746 --> 08:19.957
Where a love triangle emerges...

08:20.041 --> 08:21.667
Whoa.

08:21.751 --> 08:25.838
Which means, this is...

08:25.922 --> 08:29.383
all for one man.

08:29.467 --> 08:33.387
A war between two women.

08:35.515 --> 08:36.974
NUDE GLADIATOR COMBAT

08:37.058 --> 08:40.645
It means we had some
Nude Gladiator Combat!

08:43.189 --> 08:45.191
Momo was talking to that mantis shrimp

08:45.274 --> 08:48.194
because she wanted Master Mantis
to teach her to punch

08:48.277 --> 08:50.154
so she could knock Shiratori's lights out!

08:50.238 --> 08:51.322
What the hell?

08:51.405 --> 08:52.240
Teach me.

08:52.323 --> 08:56.118
Momo was sulking the whole time
because she was jealous of Shiratori!

08:56.202 --> 08:57.703
Shut that trap!

08:57.787 --> 08:59.539
I ain't jealous of her!

08:59.622 --> 09:00.957
You are the culprit!

09:01.040 --> 09:02.500
Hold on! Stop it!

09:03.376 --> 09:04.502
Aira, are you okay?

09:04.585 --> 09:06.254
What in the world happened?!

09:06.337 --> 09:09.882
I'll help out in any way possible
if it's for you, Miss Shiratori!

09:09.966 --> 09:11.717
Thank you, everyone.

09:11.801 --> 09:14.554
Aira is mammoth-happy!

09:14.637 --> 09:17.640
But I don't really want to talk about
what happened.

09:17.723 --> 09:20.935
So I'd be grateful
if you left me alone about this.

09:22.478 --> 09:25.356
I impress myself with how high
my own popularity is!

09:25.439 --> 09:28.234
Times like this are when
your everyday efforts bear fruit.

09:28.317 --> 09:31.153
This is how this incident will dissipate.

09:31.237 --> 09:33.698
It's Momo Ayase, isn't it?
She did this to you?

09:34.574 --> 09:38.244
You've been harassed by Momo Ayase lately.

09:38.327 --> 09:40.162
Like that thing with the washtub.

09:40.246 --> 09:41.455
No way. Really?

09:41.539 --> 09:43.624
Momo Ayase's not getting away with this!

09:43.708 --> 09:46.127
Maybe she's jealous
of Miss Shiratori's beauty?

09:46.210 --> 09:47.753
What's her problem?!

09:47.837 --> 09:50.798
I heard she'll sleep with any guy.

09:50.881 --> 09:54.510
Oh, I know about that rumor!
It was going around a while back!

09:54.594 --> 09:58.097
Shouldn't we punish her in some way?
Like spread the word about her evil.

09:58.180 --> 09:59.181
Right!

09:59.265 --> 10:02.351
Let's teach her what happens
when you make our Miss Shiratori cry!

10:02.435 --> 10:03.603
So true!

10:05.521 --> 10:07.732
I'm the one who spread that fake rumor.

10:09.233 --> 10:11.485
Hold on, Aira. What's wrong?

10:11.569 --> 10:12.945
I'm at fault.

10:13.654 --> 10:16.032
So please don't speak badly of Momo Ayase.

10:16.115 --> 10:17.325
Aira?

10:19.035 --> 10:20.202
A-Aira?

10:30.963 --> 10:31.964
What the?

10:32.048 --> 10:33.257
What's going on?

10:51.984 --> 10:53.569
I've done myself in.

10:53.653 --> 10:55.696
My popularity...

10:55.780 --> 10:57.740
Stupid, stupid...

10:57.823 --> 11:00.117
Hey, what are you doing?

11:02.536 --> 11:04.622
Deranged as usual, I see.

11:04.705 --> 11:07.041
Shut up! What do you want?

11:07.958 --> 11:09.251
Nothing much.

11:12.129 --> 11:15.383
How's it on your end? Were you able
to come up with a good excuse?

11:15.466 --> 11:16.759
Huh?

11:16.842 --> 11:20.346
W-Well, yeah. They're all filled
with hatred against you!

11:22.014 --> 11:24.350
You say that, but you're all alone.

11:24.433 --> 11:27.812
You always have people stringing
behind you like goldfish turds.

11:27.895 --> 11:31.065
You've had enough, right?
Can you get lost?

11:31.148 --> 11:33.484
I mean, you are my enemy!

11:39.407 --> 11:41.909
I bet you didn't badmouth me.

11:42.493 --> 11:43.577
Of course I did!

11:43.661 --> 11:46.789
I said all kinds of bad stuff!
Got a problem with that?

11:47.289 --> 11:48.374
Yeah, yeah.

11:52.253 --> 11:56.632
I can't just go home like this.

11:57.425 --> 12:02.972
I have to earn a living for my family.

12:03.055 --> 12:05.683
This thing has the nerve
to show up again?!

12:05.766 --> 12:07.476
It's emitting some weird white fluid!

12:07.560 --> 12:10.187
Chiquitita, you have a dream?

12:18.154 --> 12:20.030
Huh? You okay?

12:21.031 --> 12:24.285
Chiquitita.

12:26.245 --> 12:28.581
Daddy!

12:28.664 --> 12:30.541
Daddy!

12:34.211 --> 12:37.298
I'm sorry, Chiquitita.

12:46.307 --> 12:48.225
T-This place is...

12:51.353 --> 12:54.356
Grandma, see, look here! This is an alien!

12:55.483 --> 12:58.611
It doesn't feel like one.
Isn't this just a kappa?

12:58.694 --> 12:59.528
No way!

12:59.612 --> 13:03.365
There's an alien right in front of you,
and you won't believe it? The hell?

13:03.449 --> 13:05.493
It just doesn't feel like an alien.

13:05.576 --> 13:06.785
This thing's totally a kappa.

13:06.869 --> 13:10.581
No, actually, there are theories
that kappa are actually aliens!

13:10.664 --> 13:14.710
Anyway, what are we gonna do
about this guy? We patched him up.

13:14.793 --> 13:17.087
He might attack us again, you know.

13:19.381 --> 13:22.843
You better not!
We got Grandma on our side!

13:26.805 --> 13:27.806
Oh, that?

13:27.890 --> 13:32.353
I had no idea what aliens eat,
so I just made some curry for now.

13:32.436 --> 13:34.563
You don't have to eat it
if you don't want it.

13:42.696 --> 13:45.658
You gave me proper medical attention.

13:45.741 --> 13:49.453
Nobody has ever
been this kind to me before.

13:51.372 --> 13:57.670
I will never ever
bring harm to you ever again.

13:58.963 --> 14:01.173
COARSE TEA / WASABI

14:03.884 --> 14:05.386
Tastes awful!

14:05.469 --> 14:09.306
Tastes awful!

14:09.390 --> 14:10.766
Why you!

14:11.809 --> 14:13.602
Don't you be eatin' just the fatty tuna!

14:13.686 --> 14:16.021
You ate my sea urchin!

14:16.105 --> 14:18.607
You're a guest!
Just stick to the pickled ginger!

14:18.691 --> 14:21.318
If I'm a guest, treat me like one!
Bring me some blackthroat seaperch!

14:21.402 --> 14:24.154
You're just a kappa!
Stick to cucumber rolls!

14:24.238 --> 14:26.448
You left some sea urchin uneaten!

14:26.532 --> 14:29.910
I was saving the best for last,
you schmuck!

14:29.994 --> 14:31.495
You ugly idiot baldie!

14:31.579 --> 14:33.038
Ugly scummy idiot baldie!

14:33.122 --> 14:36.166
Each and every one of you are scum!

14:36.250 --> 14:39.837
I'm never serving you guys sushi again!

14:41.463 --> 14:44.258
My son is ill.

14:44.341 --> 14:47.553
All his blood leaves his body
with his urine and feces.

14:47.636 --> 14:51.932
He'll die unless he's given
new blood every day.

14:52.016 --> 14:55.644
My wife died from the same illness.

14:55.728 --> 14:58.188
For treatment, I need [$@$@].

14:58.272 --> 15:00.399
What? Sorry, I didn't catch that.

15:00.482 --> 15:03.152
It's what you guys call currency.

15:03.235 --> 15:06.614
And I need tons of currency.

15:08.449 --> 15:10.367
My [@@@@] is a warzone.

15:10.451 --> 15:13.662
- Huh? I really can't decipher it.
- It can't provide me currency.

15:13.746 --> 15:18.167
So I must head out
and earn some foreign currency.

15:18.250 --> 15:21.170
We [@@] have powerful bodies,

15:21.253 --> 15:25.382
so we have jobs like bodyguards and [@/@].

15:25.466 --> 15:27.259
But I am weak.

15:27.885 --> 15:32.348
Degenerate [@@] like myself
can't find any work.

15:32.431 --> 15:35.684
There are only outlaw jobs full of danger.

15:37.645 --> 15:39.146
Because I'm...

15:39.730 --> 15:42.983
Because I'm weak, my wife had to die,

15:43.067 --> 15:49.114
I injured all of you, and my son
is facing so much hardship.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.200
I'm so pathetic.

15:51.909 --> 15:54.411
I'm so pathetic!

15:57.915 --> 16:00.000
What can I do to help you?

16:00.084 --> 16:02.586
If you have my weenie,
would that save your son?

16:02.670 --> 16:05.631
Huh? What the hell
are you talking about? Stop that!

16:05.714 --> 16:08.384
It'll be fine if he can just get paid.

16:08.467 --> 16:10.719
I can go reclaim my weenie after that!

16:10.803 --> 16:12.888
Reclaim? From where?

16:12.972 --> 16:16.058
In the first place, if the treatment
is to get new blood every single day,

16:16.141 --> 16:18.769
isn't it meaningless
to get just one cash payment?

16:18.852 --> 16:23.315
It's tough for him, but he has to work
a proper job to keep paying for it!

16:23.399 --> 16:25.943
He wants to work, but he can't find a job!

16:26.026 --> 16:27.361
How is he going to make a living?

16:28.112 --> 16:32.116
I heard that he's in trouble, so I can't
just pretend like I didn't hear it.

16:32.199 --> 16:33.826
I want to help!

16:33.909 --> 16:36.954
Calm down.
I understand how you feel, though.

16:37.037 --> 16:41.875
I'll get it back for you.
That is, your, um... you-know-what.

16:41.959 --> 16:43.293
Keep quiet, you stupid girl!

16:43.377 --> 16:46.797
When Takakura-kun is trying
to do something for someone else,

16:46.880 --> 16:50.676
if you can't support him,
you can't call yourself his partner.

16:50.759 --> 16:53.262
Don't pretend like you're his partner!

16:55.514 --> 16:58.100
What Miss Momo Ayase says is correct.

16:58.183 --> 17:01.437
The only way
is for me to find a proper job.

17:01.520 --> 17:05.649
I was very happy about
Mr. Ken Takakura's consideration.

17:06.483 --> 17:11.363
But you have been far too kind
to me already.

17:11.447 --> 17:15.951
I have made a promise
that I will not harm you.

17:16.577 --> 17:19.038
I'm sorry to stay so long.

17:19.121 --> 17:21.123
Thank you so very much.

17:21.915 --> 17:23.042
Hold it.

17:23.667 --> 17:25.753
Your blood stinks.

17:25.836 --> 17:27.713
Wait, what did you just say?

17:27.796 --> 17:29.798
That's anti-alien!
Where's political correctness?

17:29.882 --> 17:31.216
Shut up, you little turd.

17:31.300 --> 17:33.719
Screw political correctness.

17:35.387 --> 17:39.016
That white liquid of yours is blood, yeah?

17:39.099 --> 17:42.978
Those blood-soaked bandages
somehow smell familiar.

17:43.062 --> 17:44.563
Huh?

17:45.064 --> 17:50.444
YUJI INTENSE MILK
UNALTERED COMPONENTS

17:51.361 --> 17:53.072
Try lapping up some of that.

18:02.372 --> 18:04.166
T-This is...

18:04.708 --> 18:06.418
the same!

18:06.502 --> 18:09.338
It's the same thing as our blood!

18:09.421 --> 18:12.341
Huh? What the? Grandma, what's going on?

18:12.424 --> 18:14.051
His bandage reeked

18:14.134 --> 18:17.971
like that smell when you use
a dirty rag to wipe up some milk.

18:18.055 --> 18:20.557
Milk is cow's "blood" to begin with,

18:20.641 --> 18:23.936
but of all things kappa's blood was milk, too?

18:24.019 --> 18:26.522
Seriously? Then you should take
tons of milk back with you!

18:26.605 --> 18:28.774
Dover Demon's blood is milk!

18:28.857 --> 18:31.401
But it's a little thin.

18:31.485 --> 18:34.363
They homogenize it
so it's easy for humans to drink.

18:35.197 --> 18:39.952
I'll ask a dairy farmer I know
to give you one whole cow.

18:40.035 --> 18:42.704
Well, good luck with everything.

18:42.788 --> 18:44.706
Take care of yourself.

18:53.799 --> 18:57.177
INTENSE MILK

19:01.974 --> 19:05.144
Thank you!

19:05.227 --> 19:09.523
I will never forget this generosity!

19:09.606 --> 19:16.530
If something ever happens,
I will make sure to be your ally!

19:16.613 --> 19:18.157
- It's Cattle Mutilation!
- A live Abduction!

19:18.240 --> 19:19.825
Shut up! Hurry up and go home!

19:19.908 --> 19:23.245
Amazing! So huge! So awesome!

19:24.037 --> 19:26.790
Hope we meet again!

19:42.890 --> 19:45.350
Grandma, you believe in aliens now, right?

19:45.434 --> 19:47.519
Huh? That was just a kappa.

19:47.603 --> 19:50.272
Huh? Okarun,
say something to this old hag!

19:50.355 --> 19:53.525
There's a theory that kappa are aliens.

19:56.612 --> 19:57.946
Please!

19:58.030 --> 20:01.742
Buy us some school uniforms
with Ms. Dodoria's appearance fees!

20:01.825 --> 20:07.164
How many times do I have
to buy your uniforms, you dumbasses?

20:07.247 --> 20:09.875
Next time,
we will wear them very carefully!

20:09.958 --> 20:11.835
Is it okay for us, too?

20:11.919 --> 20:13.462
We don't have any money.

20:13.545 --> 20:17.549
In times like this, it's best to exploit
the financial power of adults.

20:17.633 --> 20:19.426
By the way, this is the third time.

20:19.509 --> 20:22.429
Aira and Four-Eyes,
I'll buy uniforms for you two.

20:23.430 --> 20:26.516
Hold on! Why am I not included?

20:26.600 --> 20:28.769
I don't like your eyes.

20:28.852 --> 20:31.980
Those eyes that want to exploit
the financial power of adults.

20:33.065 --> 20:35.192
So until I say you're done...

20:35.275 --> 20:37.194
do an impersonation of Hiroshi Abe.

20:37.694 --> 20:41.531
Gimme a break!
I'd never do anything like that!

20:41.615 --> 20:45.661
Come on, say it.
Who are you speaking to? Say it!

20:45.744 --> 20:48.872
You okay with that?
With no deal for your uniform?

20:48.956 --> 20:50.874
I don't care either way.

20:50.958 --> 20:54.169
I don't wanna wear
a school uniform anyway.

20:58.548 --> 21:00.300
What's with that face?
That's so out there!

21:00.384 --> 21:01.301
So cute.

21:01.385 --> 21:04.429
- So?
- That's nothing like him! How irritating!

21:06.807 --> 21:10.435
Hey, Momo. You answer that.
Keep doing your impersonation, though.

21:10.519 --> 21:12.187
Rocket Engine Valve.

21:12.271 --> 21:13.105
Miss Ayase!

21:13.188 --> 21:14.356
Rocket Engine Valve.

21:14.439 --> 21:17.818
I'm watching you from here.
You better not stop!

21:20.195 --> 21:22.072
Rocket Engine Valve.

21:23.115 --> 21:24.074
Hello.

21:24.157 --> 21:25.784
I am Rocket Engine Valve.

21:27.911 --> 21:29.746
Huh? Momo?

21:29.830 --> 21:31.164
Jiji?

21:34.626 --> 21:38.213
Yo. You're finally here.
I heard all about it from your mom.

21:38.297 --> 21:40.507
Huh? What? Why is he here?

21:40.590 --> 21:42.467
Who is that?

21:42.551 --> 21:45.846
That guy is Momo's childhood friend...

21:51.935 --> 21:53.520
and her first love.

23:28.490 --> 23:29.616
What is this feeling I have?

23:29.699 --> 23:31.284
Hey, you believe in aliens, right?

23:31.368 --> 23:32.828
That was a kappa, no doubt.

23:32.911 --> 23:35.080
Takakura-kun called it a Dover Demon.

23:35.163 --> 23:37.666
I'm sure she's just shaken because
she witnessed Cattle Mutilation!

23:37.749 --> 23:39.126
Next episode, "First Love."

23:39.209 --> 23:40.710
By the way, outside of alien theories,

23:40.794 --> 23:42.921
a kappa is called chupacabra
in some regions...
